---
description: Decide field-level findings for mapCoverage.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Build a map of themes, formats, perspectives, and reader needs across proposed pieces. Identify genuine gaps and redundancy without forcing artificial balance between unsupported claims, and preserve coherent variety rather than filling slots mechanically. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
